description: Updates settings of an Azure storage account (encryption, HTTPS-only
  enforcement, minimum TLS version, public blob access, network rules, tags) to remediate
  cloud posture issues. REQUIRES `resource_group_name`, `subscription_id`, and `account_name`;
  if not in user input, resolve them first via `CortexListAssets` using the issue's
  asset_id or asset_name.
